docs {
  Updates an existing patient record request if processing has not started. If the request can no longer be updated, the response indicates that the update was unsuccessful.

  ### Fields

  | Field | Description |
  |---|---|
  | `requestId` | Request id. |

  ### Example response 200 OK

  ```json
  {
    "message": "Request updated successfully",
    "requestId": "9542d23b-47aa-d742-4742-fbbbe7cde90e",
    "partnerPatientId": "b8b7c7da-a814-c731-a23e-c6950c7f42d0",
    "status": "OPEN",
    "referenceId": "1234567890"
  }
  ```
}
